WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.934 --> 00:00:18.255
One day Dad brought home a box.

2
00:00:18.256 --> 00:00:22.985
"What's in there?" asked Oliver.

3
00:00:22.986 --> 00:00:26.525
"It's a surprise for Emmy," said Dad.

4
00:00:26.526 --> 00:00:38.577
“Maybe Emmy would like a pet."

5
00:00:38.578 --> 00:00:43.231
"Emmy loves snakes," said Oliver.

6
00:00:43.232 --> 00:00:47.273
"I bet it's a snake!"

7
00:00:47.274 --> 00:00:51.234
"I think it's a snake too," said Harry.

8
00:00:51.235 --> 00:00:54.225
"Snakes, snakes, snakes!

9
00:00:54.226 --> 00:00:58.650
Emmy talks about them all the time."

10
00:00:58.651 --> 00:01:02.252
"You're right, boys," said Dad.

11
00:01:02.253 --> 00:01:05.718
He took the lid off the box.

12
00:01:05.719 --> 00:01:09.503
"Cool!" said Oliver.

13
00:01:09.504 --> 00:01:12.687
The snake had black-and-white stripes.

14
00:01:12.688 --> 00:01:16.982
Its tongue was shaped like a fork.

15
00:01:16.983 --> 00:01:21.211
"It looks like Emmy's toy snake," said Harry.

16
00:01:21.212 --> 00:01:25.036
Oliver and Harry took the snake outside.

17
00:01:25.037 --> 00:01:31.416
They touched the scales on its head.

18
00:01:31.417 --> 00:01:37.911
They watched it move across the grass.

19
00:01:37.912 --> 00:01:41.482
The snake's tongue flicked in and out.

20
00:01:41.483 --> 00:01:44.457
"Wow," said Oliver.

21
00:01:44.458 --> 00:01:48.597
"This is the best snake ever."

22
00:01:48.598 --> 00:01:52.638
"I know," Harry agreed.

23
00:01:52.639 --> 00:01:58.104
"Wait till Emmy sees this snake."

24
00:01:58.105 --> 00:02:08.753
Finally Emmy came home from soccer practice.

25
00:02:08.754 --> 00:02:11.836
"Guess what, Emmy!" said Harry.

26
00:02:11.837 --> 00:02:17.174
"Dad got you a cool surprise!" said Oliver.

27
00:02:17.175 --> 00:02:23.137
Harry took the lid off the box.

28
00:02:23.138 --> 00:02:26.667
"Agh!" screamed Emmy.

29
00:02:26.668 --> 00:02:28.542
"It's a snake!"

30
00:02:28.543 --> 00:02:31.142
"What?" said Dad.

31
00:02:31.143 --> 00:02:34.983
Everyone was confused.

32
00:02:34.984 --> 00:02:38.086
"But you love snakes," said Harry.

33
00:02:38.087 --> 00:02:50.944
"Not real ones!" said Emmy.
